abstract: "v1.0 freeze: Opera Numerorum. Full tower typed and audit-clean. Tower: p||N → M*p=N (real) → S2(2)=0 dim 0 rfl → Modularity Hypothesis (explicit axiom) → BealConjecture. Audit: B03,B04,B10,B20 Core [] axioms; B05 Modularity [modularity_hypothesis]+[propext] only; 0 sorry; 0 Prop:=True stubs. 4 DOIs across v0.2.0–v1.0. Ready for FLT alignment and journal submission."
